# Soup4ALL – Food Not Bombs 🥕

![Thumbnail](/static/docs/logo_light_full.svg)

🎯 Soup4ALL Mission

The goal of Soup4ALL – Food Not Bombs 🥕 is to preserve and share information about FNB activities around the world.

The Soup4ALL includes:
* 🌍 A web platform for visualizing information about FNB groups
* 🗄 A database with a public API
* 🎲 A cooperative educational board game supplemented by a web application


_Check out the live project [_here_](https://food-not-bombs.vercel.app/)._

